And I say, 'Well, who knows? Okay?'

34
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:05,360
交易的时候没有时钟，只有机会。
There is no clock when it comes to trading. There are only opportunities.

35
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:08,895
如果市场在波动，如果日本央行有动作，如果澳大利亚有什么事，而我们在交易欧洲市场，那就没有时钟。
If the markets are moving around, if there’s a Bank of Japan,

36
00:02:08,895 --> 00:02:12,605
if there’s something going on in Australia, and we’re trading the European markets,

37
00:02:12,605 --> 00:02:13,596
there is no clock.

39
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:15,040
我们不在乎时钟显示几点。
We don’t care what the clock says.

40
00:02:15,480 --> 00:02:17,160
我们只在意机会。
We’re there for the opportunity.

41
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,380
