00:08:42,189 --> 00:08:47,935
and I've been so lucky to see a lot of them, they keep the execution simple.

189
00:08:48,900 --> 00:08:50,280
他们不会尝试金字塔加仓。
They don't try and pyramid.

190
00:08:50,460 --> 00:08:51,720
他们不会寻求摊平成本。
They're not looking to average.

