任何人都能在交易中取得成功。有一种误解，认为交易者有什么独特之处、与众不同的地方。其实没有。
Anyone can be successful at trading. There's this fallacy that traders have something unique, something special. They don't.

405
00:20:38,260 --> 00:20:40,530
交易者只是天生非常注重习惯的人。
Traders are just very habitual by nature.

406
00:20:40,530 --> 00:20:45,719
而说到习惯，我们并不只是指每天五点起床、7:30吃早饭这些。
And by habit, we don't just always mean get up at five o'clock, eat breakfast at 7:30.

407
00:20:45,840 --> 00:20:47,020
这些确实是习惯，但还有他们流程中的习惯。
Those are habits, but also habits in their processes.

409
00:20:52,040 --> 00:20:53,737
他们每天都采用相同的流程，
They adopt the same processes every day,

410
00:20:53,737 --> 00:20:55,920
这也就是为什么，最终，在每一次策略会话之后，
which is why, ultimately, after every single strategy session,

