00:20:57,619 --> 00:20:59,317
我都会让你完成模板。
I'm getting you to complete the template.

412
00:20:59,320 --> 00:21:04,660
我会让你学习一种非常习惯化的模板流程。
I'm getting you to learn a very habitual process of templating.

414
00:21:05,040 --> 00:21:11,240
如果你长期坚持这样做，你就会培养出非常强的习惯，并最终获得非常好的一致性。
If you do this over time, you're going to develop a very strong habit and, ultimately, some very good consistency.

417
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:16,780
现在，在继续之前，我提到了基于原理的方法。
Now, before I move on, I mentioned something about a principle-based approach.

