Don’t be afraid to cut and reverse there short. And then get long for the balance back up.

996
00:47:54,480 --> 00:47:56,800
显然，我们随后确实有第二个失衡。
Obviously, we do have the second imbalance then.

997
00:47:56,800 --> 00:48:01,150
再次注意市场如何回到它——之前略有吸收。
And again, note how the market comes down to it—just a little absorption beforehand.

998
00:48:01,150 --> 00:48:03,180
然后它反弹回升。好。
And then it bounces back up. Okay.

999
00:48:03,420 --> 00:48:05,300
这就是整个过程。如果我快进这个，你会看到。
And that’s the process. If I fast-forward this, you’ll see.

1000
00:48:05,500 --> 00:48:10,543
市场随后开始在半小时内回补不平衡。
The market then begins the process of filling out over a period of half an hour.

1001
00:48:10,543 --> 00:48:13,379
这就是我们不平衡案例的全部内容。
And that’s the end of our imbalance examples.

1002
00:48:13,540 --> 00:48:15,505
现在，大家一定要注意了。
Now, this is so important, everyone.

1003
00:48:15,505 --> 00:48:18,125
不平衡不仅仅是策略导向的机会。
The imbalances aren’t just a strategy-focused opportunity.

1004
00:48:18,125 --> 00:48:23,038
它们作为原理，适用于我们采用的很多其他交易策略。
They are there as principles for a lot of the other trade strategies we adopt.

1005
00:48:23,040 --> 00:48:25,838
也适用于你可能已经掌握的其他交易策略。
And some of the other trade strategies you might already have.

1006
00:48:25,838 --> 00:48:29,399
现在我们去填写下几页幻灯片中的模板。
Let’s go now and fill out the template in the next following slides.
